From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmytro Kostyshyn <dima.kostishen@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 02:12:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] horizon-bots: go through configuration again when the server
 asks

A proxy moving a player to another server (Velocity's server switch) sends
StartConfiguration in play: the bot acknowledges it, answers the configuration
as at login and joins anew, as vanilla's client does, and reports how often.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0183TW2kCwgZukLd4gu1ykmr
